# expect: reject PLN-03 PLN-06 PLN-10 PLN-13
# Four channels, each breaking a different rule: uppercase name, IMU rate 300, alarm beyond range,
# scale zero.
# CAN: heartbeat 4 B = 8*4+47+floor(65/4)=95 bit; data 8 B = 8*8+47+floor(97/4)=135 bit
# CAN: modules used 1 -> 1*95 = 95 bit/s; groups m1g0@100, m1g1@100, m1g2@100
# CAN: sum of group rates 300 Hz -> 300*135 = 40500 bit/s; total 40595 bit/s = 8.119 % of 500 kbit/s (limit 300000)
# TLM: total sample rate 600 Hz -> 6 samples per 10 ms frame -> 1 packet(s); 9*6 + 1*(22+4+66) = 146 B/frame * 100 * 8 = 116800 bit/s (limit 2000000)
iqk-plan 1
campaign blind1_c01
channel Valve_A aam:1:0 rate=100 range_mv=1000
channel gz imu:gyro_z rate=300
channel p aam:1:3 rate=100 range_mv=1000 scale=10 alarm=-10,10.5
channel z aam:1:6 rate=100 range_mv=1000 scale=0
